# SP3CPF 1.1: General Files                                                    #
#                                                                              #
# GENERAL INPUT FILES                                                          #
#   General constants       > %%%%%%%%%%%% <                                   # CONST
#   Geodetic datum          > %%%%%%%%%%%% <                                   # DATUM
#   Satellite information   > %%%%%%%%%%%% <                                   # SATELL
#   Satellite problems      > %%%%%%%%%%%% <                                   # SATCRUX
#   GPS-UTC time difference > %%%%%%%%%%%% <                                   # GPSUTC
#                                                                              #
# MENU SETTINGS                                                                #
#   Selected campaign       > %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% <   # CAMPAIGN
#   Selected session          year> %%%% <  session> %%%% <                    # YR4_INFO SES_INFO
#   Session table           > %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% <   # SESSION_TABLE
#                                                                              #
# END_PANEL ####################################################################


# BEGIN_PANEL NO_CONDITION #####################################################
# SP3CPF 2: Input Options                                                      #
#                                                                              #
# Agency                         > %%% <                                       # AGENCY
# Sampling interval for CPF file > %%%% <seconds                               # SAMPLE
#                                                                              #
# Version of CPF format          > %%% <                                       # VCPF
#                                                                              #
# Create CPF files for the following satellites                                #
# For all satellites:                                                          #
#     COSPAR, SIC, NORAD, and Name are extracted from the ILRS CB page         #
#     (go to missions subpage > current / future / past in the left submenu)   #
# For GNSS satellites:                                                         #
#     Name and Filename are related to the SIC-ID (NOT from the PRNs)          #
# For GLONASS satellites:                                                      #
#     Append further satellites and increase the SIC-ID by one                 #
#     Derive Name and Filename from this SIC number                            #
#                                                                              #
# > SVN_ COSPAR____ SIC_ NORAD Name_________ File.CPF       <                  # SATST
#                                                                              #
#                                                                              #
# END_PANEL ####################################################################
